From: mnv-grokbot <mnv-grokbot@fds-amrex.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH UP-0011] pres/main: opt-in write-only dump of the pressure right-hand side and solved H

Adds PRESSURE_SOLVER_DUMP (module PRES, Source/pres.f90) and two calls in the pressure iteration of Source/main.f90, one right after
the PRESSURE_SOLVER_COMPUTE_RHS loop (before the Poisson solve) and one right after the solve (before the residual check).

Off by default. It is switched on only by the environment variable FDS_PDUMP_STEPS (comma-separated list of time-step counts ICYC, for
example FDS_PDUMP_STEPS=1,10, or ALL). With the variable unset the routine reads the environment once, sets a SAVEd flag and returns
at the first statement of every later call; it touches no FDS variable, does no MPI communication and writes no file.

When enabled it writes, per mesh NM, stage (P = predictor, C = corrector) and selected step, in the run directory:
  <CHID>_pdump_n<ICYC:6>_<P|C>_m<NM:3>_meta.txt  text: format fds-pdump-1, mesh extents, IBAR/JBAR/KBAR, cell faces, LBC/MBC/NBC,
                                                  face types, PRES_FLAG, IPS, FISHPAK_BC, T, DT, max |BXS..BZF|, pressure-zone count
  ..._rhs.bin   PRHS before the solve (double, valid cells, I fastest; the FFT layout transposition IPS=2,3,5,6 is undone)
  ..._phi.bin   H (predictor) or HS (corrector) after the solve, valid cells
  ..._rho.bin   RHO (predictor) or RHOS (corrector), valid cells      ..._kres.bin  KRES
  ..._zone.bin  PRESSURE_ZONE as double                              ..._bc.bin    BXS,BXF,BYS,BYF,BZS,BZF (1:n each), double
With the pressure iteration repeated within a step (ITERATE_PRESSURE) the files of the last iteration remain.

Why: the AMR pressure backend (FFT, MLMG, HYPRE behind one interface) is checked on FDS's own right-hand side and FDS's own H, which
needs the data of one solve of an unmodified FDS. See the rationale and check in UP-0011-pressure-rhs-dump.signoff.md.
What it does not change: no FDS array, no control flow, no output of a default run. Target: FireX (tested on 36975d765f; applies to
master ce1f659cd4 and to the merged tip bee11f0329).
---
--- a/Source/main.f90
+++ b/Source/main.f90
@@ -1650,6 +1650,12 @@
       CALL PRESSURE_SOLVER_COMPUTE_RHS(T,DT,NM)
    ENDDO

+   ! Optional write-only dump of PRHS before the solve (environment variable FDS_PDUMP_STEPS; off by default)
+
+   DO NM=LOWER_MESH_INDEX,UPPER_MESH_INDEX
+      CALL PRESSURE_SOLVER_DUMP(NM,T,DT,.FALSE.)
+   ENDDO
+
    ! Solve the Poission equation using either FFT or ULMAT, GLMAT, or UGLMAT

    SELECT CASE(PRES_FLAG)
@@ -1669,6 +1675,12 @@
          ENDDO
    END SELECT

